{"asset_key":"ep6/quest_story_16212220","episode":"ep6","category":"quest_story","story_id":"16212220","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1621222001:1":{"text":"有什么可以帮到你们的吗？魔法师朋友。","source_cn":"有什么可以帮到你们的吗？魔法师朋友。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x05F4E28FD87403C7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1621222002:1":{"text":"哈梅尔先生，其实我们这次来……是想试着加入动物保护协会。","source_cn":"哈梅尔先生，其实我们这次来……是想试着加入动物保护协会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0836BA69E689D0C2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1621222003:1":{"text":"哈，这是你们的幽默方式吗？两个来自莱希拉姆的学院高徒，要投身我们这群林间的流浪人？","source_cn":"哈，这是你们的幽默方式吗？两个来自莱希拉姆的学院高徒，...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDCB3BE2A9AB48E8F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"哈，这是你们的幽默方式吗？两个来自莱希拉姆的学院高徒，要投身我们这群林间的流浪人？","female":"哈，这是你们的幽默方式吗？两个来自莱希拉姆的学院高徒，要投身我们这群林间的流浪人？","variant_male_record_index":"208167","variant_female_record_index":"208168","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1621222003":{"text":"哈，这是你们的幽默方式吗？两个来自莱希拉姆的学院高徒，要投身我们这群林间的流浪人？","source_cn":"哈，这是你们的幽默方式吗？两个来自莱希拉姆的学院高徒，要投身我们这群林间的流浪人？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xDCB3BE2A9AB48E8F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"哈，这是你们的幽默方式吗？两个来自莱希拉姆的学院高徒，要投身我们这群林间的流浪人？","female":"哈，这是你们的幽默方式吗？两个来自莱希拉姆的学院高徒，要投身我们这群林间的流浪人？","variant_male_record_index":"208167","variant_female_record_index":"208168","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1